  "notes": "Both images show the same pinout artwork at different resolutions; each transcribed separately. Peripheral functions are written as the column header plus the printed circled instance number and signal (e.g. 'SPI1 SCK' for a circled 1 + SCK in the SPI column, 'PWM5 A', 'ADC3'); 'HSTX' is printed as a tag for GP12-GP19. Bottom pad 1 has silkscreen 'Dout' and no callout; the other bottom pads carry silkscreen numbers 0-5, 20, 21 that the callouts tie to GP0-GP5, GP20, GP21. The corner pads belong to the side rows. No product name is printed in the images; the 'Dout' pad is consistent with an LED-matrix board."
